ckly take down multiple targets]\nThis is a simulation game designed for competitions and shooting practice."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24817750137845973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_24817750141179306_6087807556077998662_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mfEuJFBnaiMQ7kNvwH4IvXu&_nc_oc=AdoyOk2kVEKXr51m0i00kNFwKs_L6N4FYYH8FKOMDEM0I6u459-Hw5-IWtf5txOLOd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIkUzw8peKxyf7PeBmEHyGWh1fxLNouRkgQiOKmZZaaew&oe=6AA95EF0"}, {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24721984530743573", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_24721984550743571_6773484904466556326_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NX3-HGdXmosQ7kNvwGjMIV_&_nc_oc=AdrqjBXUb7qa8E8r-SKCY1J283kf3V0cvzrI0B_9KhvUtjoZqSMQfYGzt3nw1oUti_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJtfyEekH1FvsMJbKFRNNyQPIVqEZOPuzBVRxpnJNPciQ&oe=6AA96A18"}, {"file_name": "\u30ed\u30b4\u30fb\u4efb\u610f.png", "id": "4038592343072455", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310840_4038592346405788_5288807658707250735_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ymvwEZXkNSMQ7kNvwFF2myX&_nc_oc=Adq7Xun0OlUTpy6VR0RYyApxW2MuojVealGS4a3WluAkiAVWUxC5oUpXzU8z3wrXdmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJRqSxThPWrVtE-sb66844WOuxO4bGr_R5EtJ35LuAiyA&oe=6AA95CFE"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3.png", "id": "1877521716130572", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_1877521719463905_4195426819440372670_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TsTewEhviWQQ7kNvwEXVVHm&_nc_oc=Adr7iOkknwKLxVz_U_knH4e2WX9_t8k3